ref="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-dardanos">Peace of Dardanus</a> ends the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/first-mithridatic-war">First Mithridatic War</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">72–71 BCE</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lucius-licinius-lucullus">Lucullus</a> defeats <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mithridate-play">Mithridates</a> at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-cabira">Cabira</a> and occupies Pontus</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">66 BCE</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pompey">Pompey</a> routs <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mithridate-play">Mithridates</a> on the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lycus-phrygia">Lycus</a> river</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">63 BCE</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mithridates-vi-of-pontus">Mithridates VI</a> dies at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/panticapaeum">Panticapaeum</a>; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pompey">Pompey</a> divides Pontus</span></li></ol>
